{"product_id":"smok-nfix-pro-25w-pod-system","title":"SMOK NFIX Pro 25W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the SMOK NFIX Pro Pod System, featuring an integrated 700mAh battery, 5-25W output range, and uses a 2mL pod with the LP1 Coil Series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-nfix-pro-replacement-pods\" title=\"SMOK NFix Pro Replacement Pods\"\u003eSMOK NFIX Pro Replacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\" title=\"Buy SMOK LP1 Coils\"\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"nfix pro kit infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0656\/8630\/7047\/files\/SMOK_NFIX_PRO_Infographic.jpg?v=1662475531\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the NFIX Pro Pod System adopts a pen style form factor, making it a great travel pod system that fits neatly into the pocket, purse, or bookbag. Integrating a 700mAh battery within the chassis, the NFIX Pro Pod System can deliver all day vaping abilities with a refillable 2mL pod capacity. Utilizing the LP1 Coil Series, the coils are installed in a press-fit manner, while the SMOK NFIX Pro can operate via draw-activated firing mechanisms to deliver exquisite vapor and flavor that will delight the taste buds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK NFIX Pro Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110.45mm by 22mm by 13.2mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 700mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 2.0-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLP1 Mesh Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm LP1 Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm LP1 Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress-Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connenction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NFIX Pro Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NFIX Pro Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.9ohm LP1 Meshed MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm LP1 Meshed MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42019723116599,"sku":"S NFIX Pro Pod System","price":3700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_nfix_pro_-_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1765502597","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-nfix-pro-25w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




